    "name": "Anathema's Symphony",
    "steam_appid": 3292500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anathema's Symphony</strong> is a top-down rhythm-shooter that forces you to move, shoot, and dodge to the beat. It combines rhythm-based combat with modern 3D graphics and a world full of lore waiting to be explored.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/aee2b67e7ba123ddc44581255c34d73b.poster.avif?t=1731680901\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/aee2b67e7ba123ddc44581255c34d73b.webm?t=1731680901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/aee2b67e7ba123ddc44581255c34d73b.mp4?t=1731680901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Rhythm-Driven Combat:</strong> In Anathema's Symphony, every action is tied to the beat. Both the enemy and player attacks are synched to the rhythm, which often times changes, for more unpredictability and a greater challenge! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Vertical Complexity Mechanics:</strong> As you progress, Anathema's Symphony ramps up the challenge\u2014not by offering upgrades for your character, but by demanding tighter timings and better movement. Each level is tuned to be a greater challenge than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Genre-Bending Experience:</strong> Blending the top down dodging with  rhythm driven combat offers a largely unexplored take on the genre that will for sure freshen up your experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/c4faf4dc8d0fe0137c9a0f8d23a778e2.poster.avif?t=1731680901\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/c4faf4dc8d0fe0137c9a0f8d23a778e2.webm?t=1731680901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/c4faf4dc8d0fe0137c9a0f8d23a778e2.mp4?t=1731680901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to enter a world where rhythm and skill rule. With unique 3D visuals, challenging mechanics, and a musical flow that controls everything, Anathema's Symphony offers a rhythm-shooter experience unlike any other. Are you ready?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anathema's Symphony</strong> is a top-down rhythm-shooter that forces you to move, shoot, and dodge to the beat. It combines rhythm-based combat with modern 3D graphics and a world full of lore waiting to be explored.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/aee2b67e7ba123ddc44581255c34d73b.poster.avif?t=1731680901\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/aee2b67e7ba123ddc44581255c34d73b.webm?t=1731680901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/aee2b67e7ba123ddc44581255c34d73b.mp4?t=1731680901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Rhythm-Driven Combat:</strong> In Anathema's Symphony, every action is tied to the beat. Both the enemy and player attacks are synched to the rhythm, which often times changes, for more unpredictability and a greater challenge! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Vertical Complexity Mechanics:</strong> As you progress, Anathema's Symphony ramps up the challenge\u2014not by offering upgrades for your character, but by demanding tighter timings and better movement. Each level is tuned to be a greater challenge than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Genre-Bending Experience:</strong> Blending the top down dodging with  rhythm driven combat offers a largely unexplored take on the genre that will for sure freshen up your experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/c4faf4dc8d0fe0137c9a0f8d23a778e2.poster.avif?t=1731680901\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/c4faf4dc8d0fe0137c9a0f8d23a778e2.webm?t=1731680901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292500/extras/c4faf4dc8d0fe0137c9a0f8d23a778e2.mp4?t=1731680901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to enter a world where rhythm and skill rule. With unique 3D visuals, challenging mechanics, and a musical flow that controls everything, Anathema's Symphony offers a rhythm-shooter experience unlike any other. Are you ready?</p>",
    "short_description": "Anathema\u2019s Symphony is a chaotic top-down rhythm-shooter. The game of one engages 3 aspects at once: aim, positioning, and hitting the beat. All this in a dark fantasy atmosphere where Greek gods continued their lineage.",
